  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v9.0.3: CRITICAL FIX - Mediator now correctly registered as Scoped (was incorrectly Singleton) to properly support scoped dependencies in WebAPI scenarios. Fixes issues where handlers couldn't resolve DbContext and other scoped services. Both IPvNugsMediator and IMediator interfaces now use factory pattern to ensure single instance per scope. No code changes required - existing applications continue to work but now with correct scoping behavior. Strongly recommended upgrade for all WebAPI applications. Previous: v9.0.2 updated for pvNugsMediatorNc9Abstractions 9.0.6 with HandleAsync support. v9.0.1 initial release.",
